{
  "info": {
    "name": "07 — Phase 3.3.1–3.3.4 Materials + Class Unit release",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json",
    "description": "Typed Manager CRUD, assigned Mentor context/draft/submit and Manager review/publication. Login cookie jar; mutations require Origin matching CORS_ORIGINS. Queue filters reviewStatus/courseUnitId/contentType; open detail to obtain expectedRevision. Reject with trimmed nonempty reason, Mentor EDIT/resubmit, then approve. Approval publishes; unpublish keeps approval and approve retry does not republish. Admin/assigned Mentor release Class Units with LOCKED/OPEN and optional timezone unlockAt: omitted retains, null clears; same-value retry has no duplicate audit. ARTICLE assets and binary preview remain later slices. Refetch on 409 and compare; never automatically approve a new revision. Local verified; VPS acceptance pending. Requires migrations through 1791856800000."
  },
